# Normal-mapped sample (v3.0 Phase 4): a standard-material cube
# whose surface detail comes from a tangent-space normal map
# (assets/tiles-normal.ppm, generated by
# tools/make_example_textures.f90 -- bevelled tiles with rivets)
# over the checker base colour.  The v3 fragment stage builds the
# cotangent frame from screen-space derivatives; no per-vertex
# tangents are involved.
scene "normal-mapped" size 640 480 background black
camera at 4 3 7 look 0 0 0 fov 60
light directional dir -0.5 -1 -0.7 strength 1.2
cube block white at 0 0 0 size 3 material standard metalness 0 roughness 0.85 texture "assets/checker.ppm" normalmap "assets/tiles-normal.ppm"
plane floor grey at 0 -2.5 0 size 14
render
